WEBVTT

00:08:59.667 --> 00:09:02.976
Tukipiga ngoma na makofi pale ambapo besi linalia

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.351
Hapo! Chezesha mpaka chini chezesha mpaka chini kama vile

00:09:06.375 --> 00:09:08.976
Subiri mpaka, subiri mpaka uone

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.708
Hapo! Chezesha mpaka chini chezesha mpaka chini kama vile

00:09:12.417 --> 00:09:14.917
Subiri mpaka, subiri mpaka uone

00:09:16.167 --> 00:09:18.726
Kama unaifahamu na unataka kweli kuionyesha

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:22.101
Kuwa njia ya kwenda

00:09:22.125 --> 00:09:24.768
Nenda na mkamate mtu, nyonga mwili wako, muoneshe

00:09:24.792 --> 00:09:27.875
Kuwa njia ya kwenda

00:09:28.708 --> 00:09:33.708
Kwa hili najua, haya yote najua, haya yote najua